## Reviewer points not applied (treated as wrong or overridden)

- a#3 calling the partner CPA a लेखापरीक्षक and keeping “(Partner CPA)”. The partner heading is साझेदार चार्टर्ड एकाउन्टेन्ट. Column 018’s 會計師 who verifies capital is still लेखापरीक्षक (b#33); that is a different sentence.
- a#4 बिचौलिया for intermediary services. मध्यस्थ सेवा is the product term; बिचौलिया is a broker, and मध्यस्थता is arbitration.
- a#15 replacing “यो फिल्ड आवश्यक छ।” Supervisor says that sentence is fine.
- a#22 and b#15 regrouping money into lakh/Indian digits. R14 and the pinned “TWD 1.57M” figure forbid it. The checker accepts the existing comma grouping.
- a#34 and b#14 inserting 2020/2023 beside ROC years. R13: make the ROC calendar visible, do not add a Gregorian digit. Applied मिंगुओ वर्ष 109/112 (民國…) instead.
- b#8 “दोष दिन”. The English is “not attributable”, which is जिम्मेवार ठहराउन नमिल्ने, not “one must not blame”.
- b#10 “घर-सामान ओसारपसार”. ACCEPTED wording is घरसामान सार्ने सेवा, so the moving service is not the same verb as a business transfer.
- b#11 “मुख्यभूमि चीन” without the 大陸地區 gloss. The hard rule keeps the Traditional Chinese gloss.
- a#31 “मुद्दा जिम्मामा लिन” for Mandat. ACCEPTED maps that chip to वारेसनामा.

